  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku twaherize kukira, twabona kumanya ngu ekirwa ekyo nikyetwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.11.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 11:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Enzaarwa zaakyo zaatugirira embabazi ezitagirwa bantu boona; ahakuba zikatuhembera omuriro, zaatwakiira twena, ahabw'enjura eyaabaire neegwa, kandi hariho n'embeho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo ku yaateeraine omuganda gw'enku, yaazita omu muriro; ahonaaho ahabw'ekibabo ky'omuriro haarugamu empiri, emuri aha mukono neereereeta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abazaarwa b'ekyo kirwa, ku baareebire egyo mpiri emwezingire aha mukono, baagambirana bati: Buzima omuntu ogu n'omwitsi; n'obu araabe yaakira enyanja, ruhanga otasingisiriza tayenzire ku agumaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.16.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mak 16:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka Paulo yaakunkumurira egyo mpiri omu muriro, tiyaagira ku yaaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.14.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 14:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abashaija abo baateekateeka ngu naija kuzimba, nari shi agwe aho, afeereho; kwonka ku baamazire omwanya muhango bategyereize, baareeba hataine kabi akaamubaho, baahindura ebiteekateeko, baagira ngu, Ni ruhanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haihi n'omwanya ogwo hakaba hariho emisiri y'omutegyeki mukuru w'ekirwa ekyo orikwetwa Pubulio, yaatwakiira, yaatukunira gye ebiro bishatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ishe wa Pubulio akaba arwaire omushwija n'esheshe. Paulo yaataaha omu nju ye, yaamushabira, yaamutaho engaro, yaamukiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyo ku kyakozirwe, n'abandi barwaire ab'omu kirwa ekyo baija, baatambirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baatuha ekitiinisa kingi; kandi ku twabaire niturugayo, baatureetera omu meeri ebi twabaire nitwetenga byona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku hahingwireho ameezi ashatu, twarugayo omu meeri eya Alegizanderia, eyaamazire ebiro by'embeho omu kirwa ekyo, akamanyiso kaayo bari Baaruhanga b'Empasha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twahika Surakuusa, twamarayo kashatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukurugayo twayekiikuura, twahika Regio; ku haahingwireho ekiro kimwe, haija omuyaga gw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo; aha kiro kya kabiri twahika Puteoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwo twashangayo ab'eishe-emwe, baatweshengyereza kumara nabo ebiro mushanju. Okwo nikwo twahikire Rooma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab'eishe-emwe ab'omuri Rooma, ku baatuhuriire, baija, baatubugana aha Katare ka Apio, n'aha Maduuka Ashatu. Paulo, ku yaabareebire, yaasima Ruhanga, yaaguma omutima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku twataahire omuri Rooma, omukuru w'abaserukare yaamurikira embohe omukuru w'abaserukare abaabaire nibarinda Kaisaari; kwonka baikiriza Paulo kweraaza naarindwa omuserukare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku haahingwireho ebiro bishatu, yaayeta abakuru b'Abayudaaya; ku baateeraine hamwe, yaabagira ati: Beene waitu, nyowe n'obu ndaabe ntaine kibi eki naakozire aha ihanga ryaitu, nari okushobya emigyenzo ya baatatenkuriitwe, kwonka bakampayo aha Barooma ndi embohe, nibaanyiha Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarooma bo, ku baaherize kuntonganisa, baayenda kudnekura, ahabw'okuba bakareeba ntaine rubanja rw'okuunyitsa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Abayudaaya ku baabyangire, naagyemwa kujurira ahari Kaisaari; kwonka ntaine ki ndikurega eihanga ryaitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.26.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 26:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.26.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ebyo nibyo mbatumiire ngu tureebane, tugaaniire; ahabw'okuba eki naatuzirwe, kandi ekimboheise omu rujegyere oru, n'amatsiko agu Abaisraeli batuura bategyereize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo baamugarukamu bati: Itwe titukatungaga mabaruha agarikuruga Buyudaaya kutumanyisa ebyawe, kandi tihariho n'omwe omuri beene waitu oraizire aha, akatugambira enkuru mbi ahariiwe, n'obu kwakuba okukugambaho kubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.2.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 2:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mbwenu ka tuhurire eki orikuteekateeka; ahakuba ekigombe eki nikijumwa hoonahoona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baamuraganisa erindi izooba; baija baingi omu nju ei yaabaire acumbikiremu. Yaabashobororera okuruga omu kasheeshe okuhitsya omu mwabazyo, naabahamiza eby'obukama bwa Ruhanga, naateeraho, kubaikiririsa ebya Yesu, naiha omu Biragiro bya Musa n'omu bya Baanabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamwe baikiriza ebi yaabagambira, abandi tibaabiikiriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku baabire nibenda kurugayo bataikirizaine, Paulo yaayongyera kubagambira ekigambo kimwe ati: Ebi Omwoyo Orikwera yaagambiire baashwenkuriimwe omu kanwa ka nabi Isaaya, akabigamba gye ati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
